WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,350
It turns out that you are not here to help me live longer.

2
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:04,710
It's my uncle who's causing trouble for me

3
00:00:04,710 --> 00:00:06,070
I didn't mean that

4
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:08,960
uncle and aunt

5
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,400
I only represent the Su family

6
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,320
Asking to see Miss Youyou and her uncle

7
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:13,440
what are you doing

8
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:15,240
If you have something to say, speak it up quickly.

9
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,440
Miss Youyou won’t come out

10
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:19,520
I didn’t get up yesterday

11
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,890
That child Yoyo yesterday

12
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:24,170
I had a little trouble with my family

13
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:25,890
She moved out

14
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:26,890
Where is she now?

15
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:29,290
I'll go find her right now

16
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:31,290
There’s no need for you to make a trip.

17
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:33,610
I'll give Qingzhou a call

18
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:38,490
Let her bring people back

19
00:00:38,490 --> 00:00:39,890
what does this mean

20
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:44,060
Maybe the signal is not

21
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:45,780
Why don't you tell me the address?

22
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:48,930
I'll go in person, old minister

23
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:50,530
Go and give me everyone

24
00:00:50,530 --> 00:00:55,870
please come back to me

25
00:00:55,870 --> 00:00:58,270
Yesterday, Master, you asked people not to come back to this house

26
00:00:58,270 --> 00:01:00,390
Today we have everyone come back

27
00:01:00,390 --> 00:01:02,060
Isn't this sick?

28
00:01:02,060 --> 00:01:07,040
Go to them quickly

29
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:09,880
I have already set off to celebrate Grandpa Lu’s birthday.

30
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:12,920
Two little brats eating inside and outside

31
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:14,720
His biological grandfather is still alive

32
00:01:14,720 --> 00:01:17,560
They actually went to celebrate another old man's birthday

33
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:18,680
Where is the Lu family?

34
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:19,840
Do you have the address?

35
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:21,680
I asked the driver to navigate directly

36
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:24,350
Isn't the Lu family the family that adopted Youyou?

37
00:01:24,350 --> 00:01:26,190
I have raised your granddaughter for more than three years.

38
00:01:26,190 --> 00:01:28,870
Don't you even come to say thank you?

39
00:01:28,870 --> 00:01:30,270
When Youyou Renzu returned to his clan

40
00:01:30,270 --> 00:01:32,350
Didn't you go to the Lu family to pick someone up in person?
